      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "### The problem\n\nThe MQTT integration is being used to manage Z2M and apart of that, I've enabled the last seen entity on all devices (I've tried all the formats, ISO-8601, ISO-8601-local and epoch). The data is present in the payload of the topic, in the example case, it's `zigbee2mqtt/Motion Sensor 4`, and the payload is pasted below\n\nThe last seen is a property in the payload like so `\"last_seen\": \"2025-12-31T16:57:15.676Z\",` and Home Assistant does recognise it as a diagnostic entity to enable for the device, but when enabled, the integration doesn't interpret the property in the payload and the entity shows as unavailable.\n\n### What version of Home Assistant Core has the issue?\n\ncore-2025.12.3\n\n### What was the last working version of Home Assistant Core?\n\n_No response_\n\n### What type of installation are you running?\n\nHome Assistant Container\n\n### Integration causing the issue\n\nmqtt\n\n### Link to integration documentation on our website\n\nhttps://www.home-assistant.io/integrations/mqtt/\n\n### Diagnostics information\n\n[mqtt-motion-sensor.json](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24396327/mqtt-motion-sensor.json)\n\n### Example YAML snippet\n\n```yaml\n{\n    \"battery\": 100,\n    \"device\": {\n        \"applicationVersion\": 1,\n        \"dateCode\": \"20240123\",\n        \"friendlyName\": \"Motion Sensor 4\",\n        \"hardwareVersion\": 1,\n        \"ieeeAddr\": \"0xf074bffffee14d2f\",\n        \"manufacturerID\": 4476,\n        \"manufacturerName\": \"IKEA of Sweden\",\n        \"model\": \"E2134\",\n        \"networkAddress\": 11304,\n        \"powerSource\": \"Battery\",\n        \"softwareBuildID\": \"1.0.64\",\n        \"stackVersion\": 114,\n        \"type\": \"EndDevice\",\n        \"zclVersion\": 8\n    },\n    \"illuminance\": 4771,\n    \"illuminance_lux\": 3,\n    \"last_seen\": \"2025-12-31T16:52:38.925Z\",\n    \"linkquality\": 207,\n    \"occupancy\": true,\n    \"update\": {\n        \"installed_version\": 16777316,\n        \"latest_version\": 16777316,\n        \"state\": \"idle\"\n    },\n    \"update_available\": null\n}\n```\n\n### Anything in the logs that might be useful for us?\n\n```txt\nThe message when looking at the last seen property of any z2m devices in home assistant\n\n`This entity is no longer being provided by the mqtt integration. If the entity is no longer in use, delete it in settings.`\n```\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
